# sememe program: the ontology (concepts, roles, meaning features).

/// Anything at all: the top of the type hierarchy.
c0 concept Thing < Thing  @0 seed
/// A participant in a conversation, introduced by a speaker tag or as the narrator of written text.
c1 concept Speaker < Thing  @0 seed

/// An argument of a word whose meaning is not known yet.
r0 role arg : Thing -> Thing  @0 seed
/// Something an unknown modifier word adds.
r1 role mod : Thing -> Thing  @0 seed
/// One of the things joined by a coordination.
r2 role op : Thing -> Thing  @0 seed

